Source: sv-armory-ad
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Maintainer: z1rov <fabian@zirov.net>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0

Package: sv-armory-ad
Architecture: all
Depends: svent-core, curl, ca-certificates, unzip, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Svent AD armory (Windows attack binaries downloader)
 Downloads Active Directory / Windows attack binaries and scripts (Rubeus,
 Certify, SharpHound, mimikatz, winPEAS, PowerView.ps1, Sysinternals, ...)
 into /usr/share/armory/ad for uploading to compromised Windows hosts.
 Binaries are fetched from their upstream projects at install time.
